                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
                        <div class="flex-1 text-right pr-1">
                            <span class="inline-block text-[11px] font-bold text-[#ffd18a] bg-[#ffd18a]/15 border border-[#ffd18a]/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full mb-2 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,248,220,0.45)]">
                                مساعدك الذكي للتعلم ✨
